   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.174
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "提案生效后，cbETH 的美元价格，只用了 cbETH 对 ETH 的汇率。",
   "spoken": "提案生效后，cbETH 的美元价格，只用了 cbETH 对 ETH 的汇率。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.228,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 8.326,
   "speechEnd": 13.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "它把一个汇率，当成了美元价格。",
   "spoken": "它把一个汇率，荡成了美元价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 14.352,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 14.45,
   "speechEnd": 16.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一枚约 2200 美元的 cbETH，在合约眼里，只值约 1.12 美元。",
   "spoken": "一枚约 2200 美元的 cbETH，在合约眼里，只值约 1.12 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.716,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 17.814,
   "speechEnd": 23.254
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "清算机器人立刻动手，清算了约 1096 枚 cbETH。",
   "spoken": "清算机器人立刻动手，清算了约 1096 枚 cbETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.32,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 24.418,
   "speechEnd": 28.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "按 The Block 的报道，协议留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 的报道，协议留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.82,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 29.918,
   "speechEnd": 33.537
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.6,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 34.698,
   "speechEnd": 35.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这个价格大于 0，而且刚刚更新过。",
   "spoken": "这个价格大于 0，而且刚刚更新过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.908,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 37.006,
   "speechEnd": 39.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "只检查正值和时效，能拦住它吗？",
   "spoken": "只检查正值和时效，能拦住它吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.824,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 40.922,
   "speechEnd": 44.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "不能。两项检查，都会通过。",
   "spoken": "不能。两项检查，都会通过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.38,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 45.478,
   "speechEnd": 48.606
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "价格是新的，也是错的。",
   "spoken": "价格是新的，也是错的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
